LICENCE AND SCOPE OF USE
========================

This file records what is covered by a licence in this folder, and what is not.
It is not a licence over the law texts. Those are not ours to license.


1. WHAT THIS COVERS
-------------------

The project metadata in this folder:

  - pdf_manifest.json
  - NOTICE.md
  - README.md
  - DISCLAIMER.md
  - the folder structure and filenames
  - the provenance pages appended to each PDF

These are released under CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication).
You may copy, change, and reuse them without asking, and without attribution.

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/


2. WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER
---------------------------

The PDF files in the pdf/ folder.

These are official Malaysian Government publications and, in one case, a UN FAO publication. They are not our work. All rights in them stay with their publishers. This licence grants nothing over them and takes nothing away.

They are held for internal reference only. They must not be redistributed or published. Do not commit them to a public repository.

The rights position for each of the four documents held here, document by document:

  (1) Act 127 - Environmental Quality Act 1974
      File:   Act127_EnvironmentalQualityAct1974_asat-2006.pdf
      Source: AGC portal, lom.agc.gov.my
      Rights: Copyrights © 2026 All Rights Reserved by Attorney General's Chambers of Malaysia.

  (2) Act A1712 - Environmental Quality (Amendment) Act 2024
      File:   A1712_EnvironmentalQualityAmendmentAct2024.pdf
      Source: AGC portal, lom.agc.gov.my
      Rights: Copyrights © 2026 All Rights Reserved by Attorney General's Chambers of Malaysia.

  (3) Act 341 - Fire Services Act 1988
      File:   Act341_FireServicesAct1988_asat-2009.pdf
      Source: AGC portal, lom.agc.gov.my
      Rights: Copyrights © 2026 All Rights Reserved by Attorney General's Chambers of Malaysia.

  (4) P.U.(A) 460/2003 - Environmental Quality (Declared Activities) (Open Burning) Order 2003
      File:   PUA460-2003_EnvironmentalQualityOpenBurningOrder2003.pdf
      Source: FAOLEX, UN Food and Agriculture Organization, faolex.fao.org
      Rights: FAOLEX open data, distributed under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 IGO and FAO's Terms and Conditions. Non-commercial use, with attribution and share-alike. Recommended citation: "FAO. FAOLEX Database. License: CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 IGO. Extracted from www.fao.org/faolex/opendata."

No licence in this folder grants any right over any of these four documents.
No rights are claimed over any of them.

Whichever terms apply above, the project treats all four as internal reference material and does not redistribute them. The internal-only rule is a project policy, stricter than the FAOLEX licence in item (4) requires.


3. WHAT THE LICENCE DOES NOT CLAIM
----------------------------------

This file does not claim ownership of any law text.
This file does not grant permission to use the law texts.
The basis on which these texts are used is recorded in NOTICE.md.


4. NO WARRANTY AND NO LEGAL ADVICE
----------------------------------

The metadata is provided as is, with no warranty of accuracy or fitness.
Nothing in this folder is legal advice. The documents are reference material only. Always check the current revision on the source portal before relying on any text.


5. PURPOSE
----------

The project metadata was prepared for a hackathon prototype, to make the reference set auditable.

The CC0 dedication in section 1 covers the project metadata only. It does not extend to the PDF files in pdf/, which must not be redistributed.
